<Layout title="Privacy Policy — Vandhara Agrotech" description="Vandhara Agrotech privacy policy — how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when you submit quote requests or contact forms.">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 lg:py-20 prose prose-green">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-green">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Last updated: May 2026</p>

    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>When you submit a quote request or contact form on our website, we collect:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Your name and contact information (phone, email)</li>
      <li>Business details (shop name, GST number, address) if you are a dealer or distributor</li>
      <li>Crop and land information if you are a farmer</li>
      <li>Any additional information you choose to provide in your message</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>We use the information you provide to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Respond to your quote requests and enquiries</li>
      <li>Provide product recommendations and support</li>
      <li>Process dealer and distributor partnerships</li>
      <li>Improve our products and services</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Data Sharing</h2>
    <p>We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. We may share your data with:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Web3Forms:</strong> Our form submission service processes your enquiries and emails them to us</li>
      <li><strong>Legal authorities:</strong> If required by law or to protect our rights</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Data Security</h2>
    <p>We implement reasonable security measures to protect your personal information. However, no method of transmission over the Internet is 100% secure.</p>

    <h2>Your Rights</h2>
    <p>You have the right to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Request access to the personal data we hold about you</li>
      <li>Request correction or deletion of your data</li>
      <li>Withdraw consent at any time</li>
    </ul>
    <p>To exercise these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:vandharaagrotech@gmail.com">vandharaagrotech@gmail.com</a>.</p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>This website does not use tracking cookies. We may use basic session cookies for functionality, but no personal data is collected through cookies.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For privacy-related enquiries:<br>
    Vandhara Agrotech (A brand of Lasius International Private Limited)<br>
    First Floor, Shop No-4, Real Plaza -2, 8A National Highway, Lalpar, Morbi, Gujarat - 363642<br>
    Email: <a href="mailto:vandharaagrotech@gmail.com">vandharaagrotech@gmail.com</a><br>
    Phone: +91 63592 99124</p>
  </article>
